.\" man/man3/TreeSitter::Language.3cr
.\" Generated by scripts/man.cr from README.md and the doc comments; regenerate instead of editing.
.TH "TreeSitter::Language" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "treesitter 0.1.0" "treesitter API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
TreeSitter::Language \- A grammar: the parse tables a \fB\%Parser\fR uses.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "treesitter"\fR
.sp
\fBclass TreeSitter::Language\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A grammar: the parse tables a \fB\%Parser\fR uses. Load one from a shared library with \fB\%Language.load\fR, or wrap the
pointer a linked \fB\%tree_sitter_<name>\fR function returns. Loaded libraries stay open for the life of the process.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBMAX_ABI = 15\fR
Newest grammar ABI version this library parses.
.TP 4
\fBMIN_ABI = 13\fR
Oldest grammar ABI version this library parses.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.load(path : String, name : String, symbol : String = "tree_sitter_#{name.tr("\-", "_")}") : Language\fR
Opens the shared library at \fIpath\fR and calls its \fIsymbol\fR (by default \fB\%tree_sitter_<name>\fR, dashes as
underscores); raises \fB\%Error\fR when the library or the symbol is missing.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.load(name : String) : Language\fR
Finds and loads grammar \fIname\fR from \fB\%directories\fR; raises \fB\%Error\fR when no matching shared library exists.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.new(pointer : Pointer(Void), name : String | Nil = nil)\fR
Wraps \fIpointer\fR, the result of a grammar\(aqs \fB\%tree_sitter_<name>()\fR; raises \fB\%Error\fR for a null pointer or an
unsupported ABI version.
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.directories : Array(String)\fR
Directories searched by \fB\%Language.find\fR, in order. Defaults to the per\-user and system library directories;
replace or reorder the array to configure lookup.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.directories=(directories : Array(String))\fR
Directories searched by \fB\%Language.find\fR, in order. Defaults to the per\-user and system library directories;
replace or reorder the array to configure lookup.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.find(name : String) : String | Nil\fR
Finds the shared library for grammar \fIname\fR in \fB\%directories\fR, looking for \fB\%libtree\-sitter\-<name>.so\fR and
\fB\%<name>.so\fR in each directory; returns its path, or \fB\%nil\fR when no library exists.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef abi_version : Int32\fR
The grammar\(aqs ABI version.
.TP 4
\fBdef name : String | Nil\fR
The name given when loading, if any.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/tree_sitter/language.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "TreeSitter" (3cr),
.BR "TreeSitter::Error" (3cr),
.BR "TreeSitter::Parser" (3cr),
.BR "treesitter" (7cr)
